<title>FINLAND: FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT '96 OP PROFIT FALLS 24 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT '96 OP PROFIT FALLS 24 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit				   307 vs 402</p>
<p> Balance sheet total			   44,734 vs 37,634</p>
<p> Capital adequacy (percent)		    32.9 vs 40.5</p>
<p> Return on equity (percent)		     5.7 vs 8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned financing company is</p>
<p>Finnish Export Credit (FEC).</p>
